TY  - JOUR
TI  - Challenges and solutions in constructing a microsimulation model of the use and costs of medical services in Australia
AU  - Lymer, Sharyn
AU  - Brown, Laurie
AU  - Harding, Ann
AU  - Payne, Alicia
VL  - 4
IS  - 3
PY  - 2011
DA  - 2011/12/31
